#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js:2242
msgid ""
"Applies to all three update paths: Update N subscriptions, the per-provider "
"Update button in the panel, and the cron job. Unchecked: direct only; a "
"subscription that fails is skipped and keeps its existing nodes. Checked: "
"direct first (10s connect limit), then one retry through the local proxy "
"entry if it fails — routed by your rules, otherwise the Default outbound."
msgstr ""
"三个更新入口都适用：更新 N 个订阅、面板单机场更新、cron 定时任务。不勾：只走"
"直连，失败的订阅会被跳过并保留其原有节点。勾上：仍先直连（连接最多等 10 "
"秒），失败才经本地代理入口重试一次——这一跳按你的路由规则匹配，未命中则走「默"
"认出站（漏网之鱼）」。"

