#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/client.js:3509
msgid ""
"At the scheduled time this rule-set is downloaded and the service reloaded "
"to apply it (a 2-3 second reconnect). Only one rule-set updates at a time; "
"leave 1-3 minutes between rule-sets and prefer off-peak hours such as the "
"early morning."
msgstr ""
"到点自动下载本规则集并重载服务使其生效（2~3 秒的瞬时重连），同一时间只执行一"
"条更新，相邻规则集建议间隔 1~3 分钟，建议设置为闲时如凌晨。"

